  "description": "Two original, openly MIT-licensed academic LaTeX template PDFs retained byte-for-byte from pinned GitHub revisions. Ground truth is manually curated by the assistant from independent extracted text and visual page review. It covers selected pages only, not the full documents. Every annotation in this file comes from assistant review of the rendered page and of Poppler-extracted text; no human reviewed these annotations.",
  "independentReview": {
    "textExtraction": "Poppler pdftotext, performed independently of the extractor under evaluation. Two-column pages are extracted column by column with the pdftotext crop box so that the columns are read left before right.",
    "visualReview": "The assistant rendered pages with Poppler pdftoppm at 110 dpi and visually reviewed the complete annotated page for each PDF. This is assistant review, not human review.",
    "reviewNote": "Assistant review only: every annotated sentence and exclusion was curated by the assistant from rendered pages and Poppler-extracted text. No human reviewed these annotations.",
    "geometry": "PyMuPDF 1.26.7 extracted character geometry independently from the PDFs. Geometry is retained for every original page; unannotated pages have empty chars arrays. PDF coordinates are converted to bottom-left origin.",
